# Issue Loop Engineering

## Session start (in order)

1. **Check human replies**: `node scripts/check-issue-replies.mjs`
   - For `withReplies`: read `gh issue view <N> --comments`, record ADR in `docs/en/specs/`, close or update issue, remove `needs-human`
   - See [docs/en/workflows/check-issue-replies.md](../../docs/en/workflows/check-issue-replies.md)
2. **Poll agent tasks**: `gh issue list --repo tanbamboo/rusql --label agent-ready --json number,title,labels`
3. If none: update HANDOFF.md and stop
4. Pick highest priority (`priority:P0` > P1 > P2 > P3)
5. Read full issue body as spec; follow docs/en/workflows/spec-to-ship.md

## On completion

1. Run sensors: `cargo fmt`, `clippy`, `test`, `harness-validate`
2. Open PR with `Closes #N`
3. Remove `agent-ready` label; add `needs-review`
4. Update HANDOFF.md with next issue

## File Boundaries

Never modify files outside the issue's declared boundaries.

## Single Area

Prefer one `area:*` label per PR.
